  "netlist": "# Atari Punk Console - Paul in the Lab\n# R2/R3 wired as rheostats: wiper tied to lug 1.\n# R4 is the off-board volume pot; its wiper goes straight to the output jack,\n# so OUT never appears on the board.\n\nVIN:      @VIN @R2_A @R3_A IC1.4 IC1.8 IC2.4 IC2.8\nGND:      @GND @R4_3 IC1.1 IC2.1 C1.B C2.B\n\nIC1_DIS:  IC1.7 R1.A @R2_B\nIC1_TIM:  IC1.2 IC1.6 R1.B C1.A\nIC1_OUT:  IC1.3 IC2.2\n\nIC2_TIM:  IC2.6 IC2.7 C2.A @R3_B\nIC2_OUT:  IC2.3 C3.B\n\nVOL:      C3.A @R4_1"
